  m_Name: Director Belmont
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.TrueEncounterData
  vendorName: Director Belmont
  offerText: The city smog is dreadful today. Allow me to install this large, complimentary
    air filtration engine in your quarters. Your lungs will thank you.
  acceptResultText: The massive engine hums loudly in the corner, but knowing you
    are breathing filtered, clean air makes you feel incredibly relaxed.
  rejectResultText: You decline the bulky machine. You spend the hour coughing slightly
    at the harsh city smog outside your window.
  acceptedDelayedText: The filter was defective! It actually pumped concentrated
    carbon exhaust directly into your room. You wake up gasping for air with a splitting
    headache.
  rejectedDelayedText: 
